        <mxCell id="e__note" value="<b>_note</b><br/>• No separate tables for Reports or Heat Map.<br/>• Queries join: patients + treatment_records + consultation_diagnoses + diagnosis_master<br/>• Geography from patients.residential_address (barangay) via HeatMap core.<br/>• Forecast (ReportForecast) = computed from diagnosis history, not stored." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="720" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
